  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Easy Answers**: rare: 9 archived performances [4]\n- **Slipnot!**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [4]\n- **A Hard Rain's A-Gonna Fall**: rare: 9 archived performances [4]\n- **Johnny B. Goode**: rare: 13 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **Deadco2018-07-11_akg461** (recommended): source not stated; 19 songs; 191 min; rated 2.5/5 by 2 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Fans queued about an hour, with rumors the show might be canceled [3]\n- A huge sandstorm hit before the show, wrecking Shakedown, and the stage had to be rearranged before doors [3]\n- John was placed next to Jeff for the first time at this show, and stayed that way afterward [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **Deadco2018-07-11_akg461**: taped by jimmiec; source: AKG461 (PAS) ~> Lunatec V2 ~> DR-680 (24/48 [1]. Also: Recorded with AKG461 mics at the DFC lawn, through Lunatec V2 to DR-680 at 24/48, then Audacity, CDWave, FLAC, Foobar2000 [1]",
